\ Phase 4 Slice 6e dogfood: `if` in a polymorphic body. `mymax`/`choose` each
\ branch once; `mymax3` nests an `if` inside an `if` arm, checking D4's claim
\ that nested `if` falls out of the recursive poly-walk rather than needing a
\ dedicated mechanism.

: mymax inline ( 'T: Copy Ord 'T -- 'T ) over over > [ drop ] [ swap drop ] if ;

: choose inline ( 'T 'T bool -- 'T ) | a b flag | flag [ a b drop ] [ b a drop ] if ;

: mymax3 inline ( 'T: Copy Ord 'T 'T -- 'T )
  | a b c |
  a b > [
    a c > [ a ] [ c ] if
  ] [
    b c > [ b ] [ c ] if
  ] if ;

: main ( -- )
  2 5 9 mymax3 .
  2.0 5.0 9.0 mymax3 . ;
